  Slug: the-deft
  DisplayName: The Deft
  IconPath: icons/skills/ranged/dagger-thrown-jeweled-purple.webp
  Description: Speed, subtlety, and precision. Your feet rush as fast as a gale,
    but your fingers touch as lightly as a breeze. You are trained in Thievery. After
    you Spark Transcendence, you can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Steal]
    or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Palm an Object]. When you Spark Transcendence,
    you can Interact as a free action to reload or draw a weapon ikon, either directly
    before or directly after your transcendence action. The weapon ikon must be a
    ranged weapon with the reload trait or a one-handed melee weapon with the thrown
    trait.
